<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p>Last updated: November 16, 2026</p>

<h2>1. Overview</h2>
<p>Jarvis AI Uploader is a desktop application
designed to help creators prepare and publish
short-form videos to authorized accounts.</p>

<h2>2. Information We Process</h2>
<p>With user authorization, the application
may process account identifiers, access tokens,
video files, titles, descriptions, and
publishing status information.</p>

<h2>3. How Information Is Used</h2>
<p>Information is used only to authenticate
authorized accounts, prepare content,
upload videos, and track publishing results.</p>

<h2>4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
<p>Authentication credentials and publishing
records may be stored locally on the user's
computer. Users should protect their devices
and never share access tokens.</p>

<h2>5. Data Sharing</h2>
<p>Information required for publishing is
transmitted to the relevant platform
through its authorized interfaces.
We do not sell personal data.</p>

<h2>6. Data Retention and Deletion</h2>
<p>Users may disconnect their accounts and
remove locally stored credentials and
publishing records. Data retained by TikTok
is governed by TikTok's own policies.</p>

<h2>7. Contact</h2>
<p>For privacy inquiries, visit our
<a href="https://github.com/AndriiAbramiuk/jarvis-ai-uploader">
GitHub project page</a>.</p>

